{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03C650","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这一带的道路都被绿色植被淹没了。要是有人融入自然潜伏起来，就很难发现。能藏身的地方很多，但敌人也一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":153,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"吉利服吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"总之，小心前进，别被敌人发现。最好也别穿太显眼的衣服。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"遗迹内部错综复杂，别迷路了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"反过来，也能利用那些墙壁躲开敌人的视线。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"<R=狙击兵,SNIPER>一旦被发现，就会转移到别的位置。别太执着于一个地方。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=狙击兵,SNIPER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"我知道。在苏联已经吃够苦头了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"还有，对手就算是<R=狙击兵,SNIPER>，把他拖进近身战也不代表你就有优势。要是他藏起身形，从背后袭击……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=狙击兵,SNIPER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":146,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我会小心。潜行方面可不能输给他们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""}]}